OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALady Joan's death linked to lack
OL,4,Aof medication
OL,5,
OL,6,FA private hospital's failure to provide
OL,7,Fpreventative medication contributed to
OL,8,Fthe death of Lady Joan Branson, an
OL,9,Finquest has concluded.
OL,11,FThe 80-year-old, who was married to Sir
OL,12,FRichard Branson, died on 24 November
OL,13,Flast year after suffering a cardiac
OL,14,Farrest at the private Lister Hospital
OL,15,Fin Chelsea, west London.
OL,17,FSenior coroner Professor Fiona Wilcox
OL,18,Ftold Westminster Coroner's Court on
OL,19,FWednesday that Lady Joan did not
OL,20,Freceive prophylactic anticoagulants at
OL,21,Fthe hospital despite a "very high risk
OL,22,Fof developing deep vein thrombosis".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
